    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600710/extras/78defd1ce2320a8877064efeadb83196.avif?t=1705342658\" width=615 height=220 /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>There are many scenes with zombies everywhere. Constantly challenge, accumulate experience and improve shooting accuracy;</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Need to shoot and kill various zombies in dangerous battlefields;</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Unlock levels of different difficulty to challenge, so that the battle will be more exciting.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Exciting game levels, constant challenges, exciting adventures, and more rewards.</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600710/extras/bf95b1fe3fb560afa2ce045a8ce7e3ec.avif?t=1705342658\" width=614 height=150 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >There are many soldiers with different combat skills. Cleverly combined, the team will be stronger.</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600710/extras/4d10762824afe567426b95e677085cf5.avif?t=1705342658\" width=614 height=150 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >There are many kinds of zombies. They will attack in groups. You can't let zombies break through your defenses.</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600710/extras/6f698bfad22ef1f1417eecc62b939a44.avif?t=1705342658\" width=614 height=150 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You must use flexible strategies to build your own defenses during combat.</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600710/extras/01bd1f06847f2b09a42946fd6d80d027.avif?t=1705342658\" width=614 height=150 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The classic tower defense combat mode in the game makes the game more interesting.</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600710/extras/ef481a295b2d1e6f354b8e57e12e57aa.avif?t=1705342658\" width=614 height=150 /></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600710/extras/78defd1ce2320a8877064efeadb83196.avif?t=1705342658\" width=615 height=220 /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>There are many scenes with zombies everywhere. Constantly challenge, accumulate experience and improve shooting accuracy;</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Need to shoot and kill various zombies in dangerous battlefields;</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Unlock levels of different difficulty to challenge, so that the battle will be more exciting.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Exciting game levels, constant challenges, exciting adventures, and more rewards.</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600710/extras/bf95b1fe3fb560afa2ce045a8ce7e3ec.avif?t=1705342658\" width=614 height=150 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >There are many soldiers with different combat skills. Cleverly combined, the team will be stronger.</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600710/extras/4d10762824afe567426b95e677085cf5.avif?t=1705342658\" width=614 height=150 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >There are many kinds of zombies. They will attack in groups. You can't let zombies break through your defenses.</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600710/extras/6f698bfad22ef1f1417eecc62b939a44.avif?t=1705342658\" width=614 height=150 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You must use flexible strategies to build your own defenses during combat.</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600710/extras/01bd1f06847f2b09a42946fd6d80d027.avif?t=1705342658\" width=614 height=150 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The classic tower defense combat mode in the game makes the game more interesting.</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600710/extras/ef481a295b2d1e6f354b8e57e12e57aa.avif?t=1705342658\" width=614 height=150 /></span>",
